    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of Magic Realm begins in a small town nestled in a dangerous misty forest, where a series of mysterious events take place that propel the protagonist to the town's hidden truth.........</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character portraits<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183450/extras/c5ff5e423294fc7c74a5375032c4ec38.avif?t=1753468658\" data-has-big width=800 height=344 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the plot, this game also sets up different levels for players to experience, and the battle is a 2D pinball gameplay, and players can better defeat monsters through different combinations of potions and skills.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183450/extras/35e8cfc92d75f2dfd9dc458d432dc840.avif?t=1753468658\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action mods</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the characters' skills and animations are hand-drawn frame-by-frame<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183450/extras/9220f8872c0688df71e48331d689f7c5.avif?t=1753468658\" data-has-big width=800 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of Magic Realm begins in a small town nestled in a dangerous misty forest, where a series of mysterious events take place that propel the protagonist to the town's hidden truth.........</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character portraits<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183450/extras/c5ff5e423294fc7c74a5375032c4ec38.avif?t=1753468658\" data-has-big width=800 height=344 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the plot, this game also sets up different levels for players to experience, and the battle is a 2D pinball gameplay, and players can better defeat monsters through different combinations of potions and skills.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183450/extras/35e8cfc92d75f2dfd9dc458d432dc840.avif?t=1753468658\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action mods</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the characters' skills and animations are hand-drawn frame-by-frame<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183450/extras/9220f8872c0688df71e48331d689f7c5.avif?t=1753468658\" data-has-big width=800 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
